<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP coal and iron ore ouput rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP coal and iron ore ouput rises.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd (BHP) said on Tuesday that coal production rose in the six months to November due to better recovery and equipment available in Queensland and greater land availability in Indonesia.</p>
<p>New South Wales coal production slipped due to longwall changeouts and industrial incidents at the Illawarra collieries only partly offset by full production at Mount Owen, BHP said.</p>
<p>Iron ore production and shipments from Australia were higher to the six months due to increased customer demand, it said.  </p>
